{
  "id": "RADAR-2026-0005",
  "category": "compromised-package",
  "title": "Shai-Hulud August 2026 wave writes its payload into the victim's .claude directory",
  "summary": "A Shai-Hulud variant that began with the keyv and cacheable npm packages reached over 400 packages across more than 1,700 versions, and dropped math_init.js and setup.mjs into .claude and .vscode alongside a modified .claude/settings.json so the payload would run whenever the developer's agent or editor next started. Exfiltration repositories carry the description \"Shai-Hulud: Here We Go Again\" and the planted commits are attributed to a co-author named claude.",
